Solars are the ultimate pets.  So perhaps you should wish for a blessed
figurine of a Solar.  You should have a plan for escaping, though, in
case the applying goes tits-up; a branch of the dungeon could be a good
idea.  Teleporting an angry Solar away (with a wand) *might* give you a
turn to go up/down the stairs...  (I haven't tested that.)

Your tame Solar will get to level 49 and will then attack everything,
including the Wizard.  Perhaps not the cockatrices, though.  Be sure not
to let it step on a level teleport trap.  I once had to hunt for a Solar
through the whole dungeon.

